window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>After a failed mission, Clara's life changes.</b></p> <p>Lazarus's punishment: the Ascension Games training now may cost the participants their lives before they even reach the starting line.</p> <p>A new enemy lurks in the night, and unseen magic forces two teams to become one with a common goal—survival.</p> <p>With her father's voice ringing in her head, Clara is determined to uncover the truth about the dragon-human war, punish the real culprits, and change the future of Eldmoor.</p> <p>In a crumbling city, Clara faces an enraged society and traitors who were once friends. As the new voice of justice, her choices between life and death may be humanity's last hope.</p> <p>Will the new title belong to a wise leader or a cold-blooded killer? Will Clara choose to save humanity or betray the dragons?</p>"; 
